com $ Key to the species of Tubifera from Taiwan (inspired by Martin and Alexopoulos, 1969)
1,0 $ Pseudocapillitium columella-like, sometimes with branches which may reach the peridium $ T. casparyi
1,2 $ Pseudocapillitium lacking ……
2,0 $ Hypothallus expanded, not forming a stalk-like structure; spores usually larger than 6 µm in diameter $ T. ferruginosa
2,3 $ Hypothallus contracted, forming a short thick stalk ...
3,0 $ Hypothallus white, forming a stalk-like structure, densely covered by small sporangia . $ T. dimorphotheca
3,0 $ Hypothallus dark, raises slightly as a short and stout stalk without any sporangia on the rim, spores smaller than 6 µm in diameter $ T. microsperma

